{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.poster.avif?t=1760508233\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.webm?t=1760508233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.mp4?t=1760508233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive with your fluffy companions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FuwaFuwa Survivors</strong> is a survivor-style action roguelite that features buildcraft with fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control adorable animals and fight off swarming enemies in tight <strong>15-minute</strong> runs, then take down powerful bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level up during battle to <strong>evolve skills</strong>, combine them with the <strong>enchantment system</strong>, and forge your own unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.poster.avif?t=1760508233\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.webm?t=1760508233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.mp4?t=1760508233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, horde-clearing combat:</strong> hundreds\u2014then thousands\u2014of enemies for pure mow-down fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildcraft depth:</strong> upgrade skills + evolve via enchantments to create distinct playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets in battle:</strong> bring personality-packed pets for damage, control, or support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent progression:</strong> spend coins between runs to strengthen characters and unlock new options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the quick, build-focused loops of <strong>survivor/roguelite games</strong>, this one\u2019s for you\u2014and if you want extra cuteness, bring the pets along!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043830?t=1760508233","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/1b4871d545fc7917cc106fb3a97f68a6eb30375b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760508233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/f03928681482b581870313191576caaacb66765d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760508233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/f03928681482b581870313191576caaacb66765d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760508233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4052210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.poster.avif?t=1760508233\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd20