trol, or support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent progression:</strong> spend coins between runs to strengthen characters and unlock new options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the quick, build-focused loops of <strong>survivor/roguelite games</strong>, this one\u2019s for you\u2014and if you want extra cuteness, bring the pets along!</p>","developers":["\u958b\u58be\u9b42"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/d38af16be00d1501d24f8452eb73c367fb71de72/header.jpg?t=1760508233","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043830/1249835106/c37aff6958a1e92a6c9be3729b0b5f7dc3e23c1b/1758466102/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760288982","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043830/1249835106/c37aff6958a1e92a6c9be3729b0b5f7dc3e23c1b/1758466102/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760288982","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043830/1249835106/c37aff6958a1e92a6c9be3729b0b5f7dc3e23c1b/1758466102/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760288982","id":257203344,"name":"FuwaFuwaSurvivorsGameTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203344/68705660d3833d149a9ed7fb09adbfcbf2a600b5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760288982"}],"name":"FuwaFuwa Survivors","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System Requirements subject to change as development continues</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommen